# Task Manager — Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
A full-stack project and task management application. Users create projects, manage tasks
within projects, track progress via a calendar and analytics view, and monitor work on a
real-time dashboard. Dark mode is fully supported throughout.

---

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- **React 19** — functional components + hooks only, no class components
- **Vite 7** — build tool and dev server (serves from `src/frontend/`)
- **Tailwind CSS v4** via `@tailwindcss/vite` — no `tailwind.config.js`, config lives in `index.css`
- **MUI v7** (`@mui/material`, `@mui/icons-material`) — icons, Dialog, Menu, SpeedDial, DatePicker
- **Joy UI v5** (`@mui/joy`) — Snackbar notification banners on Dashboard
- **lucide-react** — lightweight icons (Search, Moon, Sun, X, SlidersHorizontal, ChevronDown, Check, etc.)
- **React Router v7** — `/`, `/projects`, `/projects/:projectId/tasks`
- **axios** — all HTTP calls, base URL `http://localhost:3000`
- **react-hot-toast** — notifications
- **chart.js + react-chartjs-2** — analytics charts (Bar, Pie)
- **dayjs / date-fns** — date utilities

### Backend
- **Node.js + Express v5** — REST API
- **Prisma v7** with `@prisma/adapter-mariadb` — ORM for MySQL/MariaDB
- **CORS** enabled globally
- All routes prefixed with `/api/taskmanager`

---

## Project Structure

```
src/
  frontend/
    app.jsx                     # Root: Routes + Sidebar + MainLayout
    main.jsx                    # Entry: ThemeProvider > ProjectProvider > App
    index.css                   # Tailwind v4 base, CSS vars, MUI dark overrides
    context/
      ProjectContext.jsx        # Global project list (fetched on mount)
      ThemeContext.jsx          # isDark state, toggles .dark on <html>, persists to localStorage
    hooks/
      useProjects.jsx           # Projects + derived counts (completed, inProgress)
      useTasks.jsx              # All tasks across all projects
    layout/
      Sidebar.jsx               # Collapsible sidebar nav + dark mode toggle (bottom)
      MainLayout.jsx            # Content shell: paddingLeft synced with sidebar width
      Dashboard.jsx             # Dashboard page header + layout
      Projects.jsx              # Projects page header + layout
      Tasks.jsx                 # Tasks page: header, stat filter cards, tab views
      taskTile.jsx              # Individual task row (edit + delete)
      TasksCalenderView.jsx     # Calendar grid + upcoming tasks panel
      TasksAnalyticsView.jsx    # Status bar chart + priority pie chart
    components/
      ProjectTiles.jsx          # Card grid + search input + FilterDropdown (status + priority)
                                #   └─ FilterDropdown  local component (custom dropdown panel)
                                #   └─ ProjectCard     local component (individual card)
      TaskList.jsx              # Task table container (header + rows)
      NewTaskModal.jsx
      EditTaskModal.jsx
      NewProjectBtn.jsx
      ProjectSettingsModal.jsx
      DarkModeToggle.jsx        # Sun/Moon toggle button (used in page headers)
      ArrowBackButton.jsx       # Back arrow — dark-mode aware via useTheme()
      ArrowForwardButton.jsx    # Forward arrow — dark-mode aware via useTheme()
      StatusTaskChart.jsx       # Bar chart (chart.js) — axes/legend color from useTheme()
      PriorityPieChart.jsx      # Pie chart (chart.js) — legend color from useTheme()
    SummaryOverview/            # Dashboard stat tiles (Total, Completed, InProgress, MyTasks)
    ProjectOverview/            # Dashboard panels (ProjectOverview, RecentActivity + their tiles)
    DashboardWidgets/           # TodaysFocus, WeekAtAGlance
    TasksSummary/               # MyTasksSummary floating popup
  backend/
    server.js                   # Express app, mounts routers
    config.js                   # PrismaClient singleton export
    projectsDB.js               # Re-exports prisma client for projects
    taskDB.js                   # Re-exports prisma client for tasks
    projectsController.js       # Projects CRUD routes
    taskController.js           # Tasks CRUD routes
prisma/
  schema.prisma                 # Project + Task models (MySQL)
ai-context/
  change-log.md                 # Full history of AI-assisted changes
  memory.md                     # Current feature status + known issues
docs/
  project-context.md            # Technical reference document
```

