## Brand Colors
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| Primary navy | `#1D3557` | Headings, body text, nav icons |
| Brand orange | `#d97757` | Active states, CTAs, accents — safe in dark mode |
| Light blue | `#e8f0ff` | Hover backgrounds |
| Sidebar bg | `#f8faff` | Sidebar background (light) |
| Teal accent | `#1f4d63` | Dashboard widgets (light) → `#5eead4` teal-300 in dark |

---

## API Routes

### Projects
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/taskmanager/projects` | List all projects |
| GET | `/api/taskmanager/projects/:id` | Get single project |
| POST | `/api/taskmanager/projects` | Create project |
| PUT | `/api/taskmanager/projects/:id` | Update project |
| DELETE | `/api/taskmanager/projects/:id` | Delete project + cascade-delete its tasks |

### Tasks
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/taskmanager/tasks` | List all tasks (all projects) |
| GET | `/api/taskmanager/projects/:projectId/tasks` | List tasks for a project |
| POST | `/api/taskmanager/projects/:projectId/tasks` | Create task under a project |
| PUT | `/api/taskmanager/tasks/:id` | Update task |
| DELETE | `/api/taskmanager/tasks/:id` | Delete task |

---

## Database Schema (Prisma / MySQL)

```
Project
  id               Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  projectName      String   (max 100)
  projectDescription String? (max 500)
  projectStatus    String?  (Planning | Active | In Progress | Completed | On Hold | Cancelled)
  projectPriority  String?  (High | Medium | Low)
  projectStartDate DateTime
  projectEndDate   DateTime
  createdAt        DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt        DateTime @updatedAt
  tasks            Task[]

Task
  id          Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  title       String   (max 100)
  description String?  (max 500)
  dueDate     DateTime
  priority    String   default("Medium")  (Low | Medium | High | Urgent)
  type        String   default("Task")
  status      String   default("Pending") (Pending | In-progress | Completed | Cancelled)
  projectId   Int      (FK → Project.id)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt
```

---

## Before Making Any Change
1. Read the relevant existing file(s) — never assume structure
2. Check `ai-context/change-log.md` for recent changes that may affect your work
3. Check `ai-context/memory.md` for pending features and known issues
4. Preserve existing UI design, spacing, and dark mode coverage
5. After substantive edits, update `ai-context/change-log.md` with timestamp, files changed, summary, and risk level
